#. Tag: author
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Lauri.Watts;"
msgstr "&Lauri.Watts;"

#. Tag: title
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "When An Application Will Not Open"
msgstr "Cando un programa non se inicia"

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes when you start an application, it does not open the expected "
"window. Here are some questions to answer and steps to help you figure out "
"what is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Ás veces, cando inicia un programa, non se abre na fiestra esperada. A "
"seguir respondemos a unhas perguntas que o axudarán a coñecer que é o que "
"vai mal."

#. Tag: term
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Did the application ever start, when launched in the same manner?"
msgstr "Chegou a arrincar o programa algunha vez, ao inicialo deste xeito?"

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If it did, for instance you have clicked an icon on your desktop that "
"previously worked, then it is unlikely to be a problem with the launcher "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Se o fixo, por exemplo premendo nun ícone no escritorio que anteriormente "
"funcionaba, entón é pouco probábel que sexa un problema co lanzador en si."

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, however, you normally start your application from an icon on &kicker; "
"and this time started it with a desktop icon, then it could simply be that "
"the launcher itself is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Porén, se normalmente iniciar o programa mediante un ícone en &kicker; e "
"esta vez o iniciou desde un ícone no escritorio, estón posibelmente só sexa "
"que o lanzador está mal."

#. Tag: term
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"But I can see the launch notification spinning cursor and taskbar entry."
msgstr ""
"Pero podo ver o notificador de lanzamento e a entrada na barra de tarefas."

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Foo</para>"
msgstr "<para>Baleiro</para>"
